OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with the
OL,6,Fchance of a few light showers across
OL,7,FEdinburgh, Lothian and Borders. Some
OL,8,Fbrightness possible across Galloway at
OL,9,Ftimes. Brisk northeasterly wind along
OL,10,Fthe Solway coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy evening and
OL,13,Fnight with a few light showers across
OL,14,FLothian and Borders. Dry with clear
OL,15,Fperiods across Dumfries and Galloway
OL,16,Falong with a few fog patches.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
