OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FLittle change, remaining
OL,6,Frather cloudy with a few light showers
OL,7,Facross Lothian and Borders. Dry with a
OL,8,Flittle brightness possible in the
OL,9,Fsouthwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fwith a few light showers on Saturday
OL,13,Fand early Sunday. Otherwise becoming
OL,14,Fdry and partly cloudy with overnight
OL,15,Ffrost and fog.
